1
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[water running]</b></font>

2
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[muffled garbling]</b></font>

3
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:15,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

4
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[garbling]</b></font>

5
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:52,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

6
00:02:10,970 --> 00:02:13,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[garbling]</b></font>

7
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[garbling]</b></font>

8
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

9
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:38,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

10
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:17,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] So, tell me,</b></font>

11
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:20,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is Mai dead?</b></font>

12
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:22,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI'S MOTHER]
It's the clan head</b></font>

13
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you should be concerned about.</b></font>

14
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:26,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And Maki's the one who's
nearly dead, not Mai.</b></font>

15
00:05:26,290 --> 00:05:27,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Is that so?</b></font>

16
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:29,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I'm glad to hear it.</b></font>

17
00:05:29,790 --> 00:05:32,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maki's a real beauty,
but she's no good.</b></font>

18
00:05:32,670 --> 00:05:34,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She can't support a man.</b></font>

19
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:36,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Any woman who can't walk
humbly behind her man</b></font>

20
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>deserves to be stabbed
in the back and killed.</b></font>

21
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:41,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now Mai's a great woman
in that regard.</b></font>

22
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:46,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
She has the same face</b></font>

23
00:05:47,010 --> 00:05:48,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the same great rack as Maki.</b></font>

24
00:05:48,970 --> 00:05:50,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She may put on a brave face,</b></font>

25
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:52,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but she understands her place
as a woman.</b></font>

26
00:05:53,020 --> 00:05:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] You're late.</b></font>

27
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:56,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where were you
and what have you been doing?</b></font>

28
00:05:56,690 --> 00:05:59,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your father is in
critical condition!</b></font>

29
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Sorry about that.</b></font>

30
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:03,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But what difference does it make
if I'm here or not?</b></font>

31
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:05,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Either way, I'm gonna be</b></font>

32
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:07,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the next head
of the Zen'in Clan.</b></font>

33
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All my older brothers
are a bunch of knuckleheads.</b></font>

34
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:14,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And, Uncle,
you're his little brother,</b></font>

35
00:06:14,370 --> 00:06:16,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but you haven't got
what it takes.</b></font>

36
00:06:16,170 --> 00:06:18,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And your daughters
are out of the question.</b></font>

37
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And Jinichi, well...</b></font>

38
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't look the part.</b></font>

39
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:28,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you had Toji's looks,
it would be a different story.</b></font>

40
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:30,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[loud thud]</b></font>

41
00:06:35,230 --> 00:06:38,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My father's dying,
cut me some slack, would you?</b></font>

42
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:40,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're all a little on edge.</b></font>

43
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:43,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OLD MAN] I see
everyone's finally here.</b></font>

44
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:47,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've been informed
that Naobito Zen'in,</b></font>

45
00:06:48,030 --> 00:06:49,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>head of the Zen'in Clan,</b></font>

46
00:06:49,370 --> 00:06:51,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has unfortunately taken
his last breath.</b></font>

47
00:06:55,370 --> 00:06:56,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am Furudate.</b></font>

48
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was entrusted by Naobito
to read his will to you,</b></font>

49
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:03,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his chosen family members,
upon his passing.</b></font>

50
00:07:04,470 --> 00:07:05,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ogi Zen'in,</b></font>

51
00:07:05,970 --> 00:07:08,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Jinichi Zen'in,</b></font>

52
00:07:08,550 --> 00:07:10,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and Naoya Zen'in.</b></font>

53
00:07:11,270 --> 00:07:13,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Since you are all
gathered here today,</b></font>

54
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:17,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shall begin the reading
immediately.</b></font>

55
00:07:17,230 --> 00:07:18,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unless, of course,</b></font>

56
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:21,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>any of you have an objection
to my doing so.</b></font>

57
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First item,</b></font>

58
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:32,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Naoya Zen'in shall be made
the 27th head</b></font>

59
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:34,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the Zen'in Clan.</b></font>

60
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:38,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Second item, Naoya shall inherit
all assets and cursed tools</b></font>

61
00:07:38,790 --> 00:07:41,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that are currently stored
in either Jujutsu High,</b></font>

62
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:44,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or the Zen'in Clan's
forbidden vaults.</b></font>

63
00:07:45,170 --> 00:07:46,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In addition to that,</b></font>

64
00:07:47,010 --> 00:07:48,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Naoya shall require agreement</b></font>

65
00:07:48,550 --> 00:07:51,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from either Ogi
or Jinichi Zen'in</b></font>

66
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:53,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before making use
of any contents.</b></font>

67
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:54,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs]</b></font>

68
00:07:55,770 --> 00:07:57,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess that's fine.</b></font>

69
00:07:57,270 --> 00:07:58,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FURUDATE] However,</b></font>

70
00:07:58,850 --> 00:08:02,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the event that
Satoru Gojo dies before I do,</b></font>

71
00:08:02,570 --> 00:08:06,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or otherwise loses the use
of his mental faculties,</b></font>

72
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:08,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then the covenant
with Toji Fushiguro</b></font>

73
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:10,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>shall be fulfilled.</b></font>

74
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:13,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Megumi Fushiguro will be
welcomed into the Zen'in Clan,</b></font>

75
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:16,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and that same person
will become...</b></font>

76
00:08:16,370 --> 00:08:20,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the new head of the Zen'in Clan,
and inherit its assets.</b></font>

77
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
Huh? What the hell?</b></font>

78
00:08:24,250 --> 00:08:26,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those guys have no balls.</b></font>

79
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:28,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They think some
unknown brat as the head</b></font>

80
00:08:28,260 --> 00:08:29,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would be better than me,</b></font>

81
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:30,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so they ain't doing jack
about it.</b></font>

82
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:35,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where's Megumi,
and what is he doing now?</b></font>

83
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:36,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI'S MOTHER]
I don't know much.</b></font>

84
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only that he's on a mission
to find Yuji Itadori</b></font>

85
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>somewhere
in the Tokyo area--</b></font>

86
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:42,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And who's that?</b></font>

87
00:08:42,310 --> 00:08:44,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He is the vessel of Sukuna.</b></font>

88
00:08:44,070 --> 00:08:45,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
Then go tell the big shots</b></font>

89
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:49,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that Naoya Zen'in is going
to kill Sukuna's vessel.</b></font>

90
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Maki's mother gasps]</b></font>

91
00:08:50,990 --> 00:08:53,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] And since Megumi
is with Sukuna's vessel,</b></font>

92
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:55,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll kill 'em both together.</b></font>

93
00:08:56,290 --> 00:08:58,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tokyo is in pandemonium
right now.</b></font>

94
00:08:59,290 --> 00:09:02,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People can die anytime
for any reason there.</b></font>

95
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:06,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once I kill him,
the rest will work itself out.</b></font>

96
00:09:09,550 --> 00:09:11,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Zen'in Clan belongs to me!</b></font>

97
00:09:17,890 --> 00:09:19,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

98
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:22,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji gasps] Die!</b></font>

99
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[indistinct shouting]
-[YUJI] Gojo no!</b></font>

100
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[NOBARA] Itadori?
-[KENTO] Itadori.</b></font>

101
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:27,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] What will you be doing?</b></font>

102
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

103
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:42,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

104
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] Yuji.</b></font>

105
00:09:55,850 --> 00:09:57,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How are your injuries?</b></font>

106
00:09:58,970 --> 00:10:01,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine, except for where
I took that Black Flash.</b></font>

107
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:03,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'm healing fast.</b></font>

108
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:06,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's probably because of Sukuna.</b></font>

109
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can feel how his power
has grown stronger.</b></font>

110
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:13,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] Yuji,
don't worry about me.</b></font>

111
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go back to Jujutsu High.</b></font>

112
00:10:16,450 --> 00:10:19,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like to retrieve the remains
of Shoso and the others.</b></font>

113
00:10:21,370 --> 00:10:22,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I'm not worried.</b></font>

114
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:25,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not an issue of me wanting
to return or not.</b></font>

115
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:29,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sukuna is plotting something
that uses Fushiguro.</b></font>

116
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:32,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, I've killed
so many people.</b></font>

117
00:10:35,550 --> 00:10:36,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
How are you going to feel</b></font>

118
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when someone you save</b></font>

119
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>goes on to kill someone
else later?</b></font>

120
00:10:40,270 --> 00:10:43,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I don't think I can stay
with the others anymore.</b></font>

121
00:10:44,810 --> 00:10:46,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How do you feel Choso?</b></font>

122
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:48,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know I killed
your little brothers, too.</b></font>

123
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] It's fine.</b></font>

124
00:10:49,730 --> 00:10:51,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was an accident.</b></font>

125
00:10:51,490 --> 00:10:53,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Eso and Kechizu would have
done the same</b></font>

126
00:10:53,450 --> 00:10:54,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if they were in my position.</b></font>

127
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:57,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Forgiving you or not
doesn't matter.</b></font>

128
00:10:57,070 --> 00:10:59,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's what it means
to be siblings.</b></font>

129
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:04,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Let's go.</b></font>

130
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need to reduce the number
of cursed spirits.</b></font>

131
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:09,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

132
00:11:24,310 --> 00:11:25,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

133
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:30,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji panting]</b></font>

134
00:11:30,730 --> 00:11:31,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

135
00:11:42,490 --> 00:11:43,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

136
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:51,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

137
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:55,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

138
00:11:55,630 --> 00:11:57,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cursed spirit groans]</b></font>

139
00:11:59,590 --> 00:12:00,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

140
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cursed spirit growls]</b></font>

141
00:12:26,330 --> 00:12:27,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

142
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:32,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cursed spirits growling]</b></font>

143
00:12:36,420 --> 00:12:38,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growling continues]</b></font>

144
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:39,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji panting]</b></font>

145
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:00,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Choso!</b></font>

146
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:08,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got 'em.</b></font>

147
00:13:21,180 --> 00:13:22,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] How terrifying.</b></font>

148
00:13:23,180 --> 00:13:25,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I already sensed he was
powerful when we fought.</b></font>

149
00:13:26,430 --> 00:13:28,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now he's added
subtlety to it.</b></font>

150
00:13:29,230 --> 00:13:32,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He has unfaltering control
of his cursed energy</b></font>

151
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:34,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and exceptional
physical strength.</b></font>

152
00:13:35,810 --> 00:13:37,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's like a war god!</b></font>

153
00:13:37,820 --> 00:13:40,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Crazy that he wasn't
in top shape until now.</b></font>

154
00:13:42,610 --> 00:13:45,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're very impressive,
little brother.</b></font>

155
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you have to keep saying that?</b></font>

156
00:13:47,540 --> 00:13:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] As often as it takes.</b></font>

157
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Remember, they should
have been there.</b></font>

158
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:58,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your father should have
also had stitches</b></font>

159
00:13:58,420 --> 00:14:00,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in his forehead, too.</b></font>

160
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:03,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Don't tell me
Megumi's not here.</b></font>

161
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:05,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I the first to arrive?</b></font>

162
00:14:05,430 --> 00:14:08,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How's that even possible?
He's way too slow.</b></font>

163
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Who's this guy?</b></font>

164
00:14:10,140 --> 00:14:12,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why's he looking for Fushiguro?</b></font>

165
00:14:12,350 --> 00:14:14,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] What are you doing
out here, anyway?</b></font>

166
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't exactly blend in.</b></font>

167
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:17,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Planning an escape?</b></font>

168
00:14:17,730 --> 00:14:18,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Escape?</b></font>

169
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:20,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] What, you don't know?</b></font>

170
00:14:20,490 --> 00:14:22,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've been sentenced to death.</b></font>

171
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:25,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all, you no longer
have Satoru's protection.</b></font>

172
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:28,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Choso growls]
-[Yuji gasps]</b></font>

173
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:29,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKUMA] There are
lots of sorcerers</b></font>

174
00:14:29,990 --> 00:14:31,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who have been saved
due to Gojo's influence,</b></font>

175
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:33,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>pride, and whims.</b></font>

176
00:14:34,330 --> 00:14:36,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
My business is with Megumi,</b></font>

177
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:39,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so to be blunt, I couldn't
care less if you live or die.</b></font>

178
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:43,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then again, I don't want you
running around willy-nilly,</b></font>

179
00:14:43,090 --> 00:14:45,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I'm gonna
break your legs for now.</b></font>

180
00:14:45,050 --> 00:14:47,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you want Fushiguro for?</b></font>

181
00:14:47,090 --> 00:14:49,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[NAOYA] I need him to die.
-[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

182
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:51,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] But it'd be great
if he could sign some papers</b></font>

183
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before he goes.</b></font>

184
00:14:52,930 --> 00:14:55,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By the way,
I heard he's looking for you.</b></font>

185
00:14:56,270 --> 00:14:57,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

186
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Choso grunting]</b></font>

187
00:15:16,370 --> 00:15:19,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's certainly faster than us.
But something is off.</b></font>

188
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Probably his technique.</b></font>

189
00:15:21,130 --> 00:15:23,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] You're doing better
than I expected.</b></font>

190
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:25,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I honestly underestimated you.</b></font>

191
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:28,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know the vessel's
got stuff going on,</b></font>

192
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:30,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but what's that thing
beside him?</b></font>

193
00:15:30,890 --> 00:15:33,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess I'll crank up
the speed a bit more.</b></font>

194
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji gasps]</b></font>

195
00:15:39,020 --> 00:15:40,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Am I feeling Gojo?</b></font>

196
00:15:46,530 --> 00:15:48,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, it's even creepier!</b></font>

197
00:15:50,530 --> 00:15:51,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Three of you?</b></font>

198
00:15:51,990 --> 00:15:53,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought you'd be alone.</b></font>

199
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who is that?</b></font>

200
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] Whoever he is,
it's bad.</b></font>

201
00:16:03,210 --> 00:16:05,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] What are your
relationships to Itadori?</b></font>

202
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:09,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] So he's also here
to execute Yuji.</b></font>

203
00:16:17,810 --> 00:16:20,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold up, pal! I'm on your side.</b></font>

204
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your name is Okkotsu, right?</b></font>

205
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:24,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Okkotsu!</b></font>

206
00:16:24,110 --> 00:16:26,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The second-year
Fushiguro talked about!</b></font>

207
00:16:26,570 --> 00:16:28,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A special-grade sorcerer.</b></font>

208
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:29,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like Gojo!</b></font>

209
00:16:29,490 --> 00:16:30,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you are?</b></font>

210
00:16:30,740 --> 00:16:33,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm Naoya Zen'in.
You know, Maki's cousin.</b></font>

211
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:36,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'm here to kill Itadori,
just like you are.</b></font>

212
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:38,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yuji, we have to run.
-[NAOYA] So relax.</b></font>

213
00:16:38,710 --> 00:16:41,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Huh?
-I'll stay out of your way.</b></font>

214
00:16:41,130 --> 00:16:43,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The blond one's fast
with some kind of trick.</b></font>

215
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:46,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need to avoid
getting into a chase.</b></font>

216
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:47,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll stall, now go!</b></font>

217
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Will you be okay?</b></font>

218
00:16:49,260 --> 00:16:51,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And in return for staying
out of your way</b></font>

219
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:52,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after you kill Itadori,</b></font>

220
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:55,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>maybe you could hold off
a bit before reporting it.</b></font>

221
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:57,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to use him as bait
for someone else.</b></font>

222
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:58,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be fine.</b></font>

223
00:16:58,770 --> 00:17:00,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're the one
they've come here for.</b></font>

224
00:17:00,770 --> 00:17:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not me.</b></font>

225
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:05,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu. Just worry about
getting away from him.</b></font>

226
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:07,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He seems like
the same type as Gojo.</b></font>

227
00:17:07,610 --> 00:17:09,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll die if you fight him.</b></font>

228
00:17:10,490 --> 00:17:13,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] I should have
kept quiet about Megumi.</b></font>

229
00:17:13,070 --> 00:17:14,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Me and my big mouth.</b></font>

230
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:18,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] My plan keeps Yuji
from fighting another human.</b></font>

231
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:20,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And prevents him from
feeling guilty toward me.</b></font>

232
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Choso chuckles]
He's such a handful.</b></font>

233
00:17:23,330 --> 00:17:25,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meet up at
yesterday's spot, Yuji.</b></font>

234
00:17:25,290 --> 00:17:26,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sounds fine.</b></font>

235
00:17:26,590 --> 00:17:28,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll leave that one
to you, then.</b></font>

236
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:29,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now!</b></font>

237
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:34,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] He's fast!
And with that sword drawn too!</b></font>

238
00:17:36,310 --> 00:17:37,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] He's pretty quick.</b></font>

239
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:39,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I planned to crush him
when he broke into a run.</b></font>

240
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:42,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Choso grunts] I was trying
to block Okkotsu's path,</b></font>

241
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:44,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but he read my move!</b></font>

242
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:46,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was watching you earlier.</b></font>

243
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:48,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's Blood Manipulation,
right?</b></font>

244
00:17:48,990 --> 00:17:51,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only I can't figure out
why you can do it.</b></font>

245
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:55,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still, it's not that scary,
aside from Piercing Blood.</b></font>

246
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:57,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And producing Piercing Blood
takes Convergence.</b></font>

247
00:17:57,910 --> 00:17:59,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a long build-up.</b></font>

248
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think there's
anything left to say.</b></font>

249
00:18:01,660 --> 00:18:03,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's checkmate.
You're going to die.</b></font>

250
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] You're the one
who will die.</b></font>

251
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:08,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you think you could go
after my little brother</b></font>

252
00:18:08,670 --> 00:18:10,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and then leave this place alive?</b></font>

253
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:16,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cursed spirit growls]</b></font>

254
00:18:20,390 --> 00:18:22,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunting]</b></font>

255
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:23,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

256
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:25,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

257
00:18:32,570 --> 00:18:35,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I'm sure
I was able to cut him.</b></font>

258
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:37,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's like Maki.</b></font>

259
00:18:53,510 --> 00:18:54,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

260
00:18:58,390 --> 00:18:59,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Surprised?</b></font>

261
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't seem like
the power type, do I?</b></font>

262
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:04,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Even without raw power,</b></font>

263
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he has an insane amount
of cursed energy!</b></font>

264
00:19:06,690 --> 00:19:08,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I actually am
on the weaker side.</b></font>

265
00:19:08,770 --> 00:19:10,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] He's enhancing himself
with cursed energy</b></font>

266
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:12,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to cover for his
lack of strength.</b></font>

267
00:19:12,490 --> 00:19:14,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone does that
to some degree,</b></font>

268
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but when he does it,</b></font>

269
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's the exact opposite of me.</b></font>

270
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:20,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you noticed?</b></font>

271
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:24,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have more cursed energy
than your teacher, Gojo.</b></font>

272
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:25,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

273
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:28,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] However,
Gojo has his Six Eyes.</b></font>

274
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So he wastes practically
no energy at all</b></font>

275
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:32,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when he activates
his techniques.</b></font>

276
00:19:33,630 --> 00:19:36,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's the best there is
when it comes to performance.</b></font>

277
00:19:36,930 --> 00:19:40,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unlike your teacher,
I can run out of cursed energy.</b></font>

278
00:19:42,020 --> 00:19:43,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Enough chit-chat.</b></font>

279
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:46,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

280
00:19:49,150 --> 00:19:51,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Shit!
-[AOI] The better the sorcerer,</b></font>

281
00:19:51,150 --> 00:19:52,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the harder it is to read</b></font>

282
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:54,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the flow of their
cursed energy.</b></font>

283
00:19:54,150 --> 00:19:55,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yours will be hard
to read as well.</b></font>

284
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:57,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] That's because
the better the sorcerer,</b></font>

285
00:19:58,030 --> 00:19:59,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the more precise
their cursed energy.</b></font>

286
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That means
you can't predict their attack</b></font>

287
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:02,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until the last second.</b></font>

288
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:03,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

289
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] But with this guy,</b></font>

290
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's cursed energy
constantly rising</b></font>

291
00:20:07,330 --> 00:20:08,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from his entire body.</b></font>

292
00:20:08,670 --> 00:20:10,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even his sword!</b></font>

293
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:12,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not even a question
of reading his moves!</b></font>

294
00:20:12,090 --> 00:20:14,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He can land decisive blows
with all his attacks.</b></font>

295
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:17,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And he can reduce all damage
to the bare minimum!</b></font>

296
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:21,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KENTO] You take it from here.</b></font>

297
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, Okkotsu,</b></font>

298
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:25,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I can't afford
to die just yet!</b></font>

299
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] There are some types
who center their training</b></font>

300
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:37,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>around the use of a weapon.</b></font>

301
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:41,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you don't want to become
dependent on a cursed tool</b></font>

302
00:20:41,370 --> 00:20:43,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and then neglect...</b></font>

303
00:20:43,330 --> 00:20:45,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>your manipulation
of cursed energy.</b></font>

304
00:20:45,750 --> 00:20:49,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So Slaughter Demon's
just an emergency measure.</b></font>

305
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:51,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]
You never taught me this!</b></font>

306
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:56,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're putting too much focus
into the blade.</b></font>

307
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

308
00:20:58,380 --> 00:21:00,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunting, yelling]</b></font>

309
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:04,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] It broke?</b></font>

310
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course it did.
He's one of Gojo's students.</b></font>

311
00:21:08,730 --> 00:21:10,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess you're not going
down easily.</b></font>

312
00:21:11,020 --> 00:21:12,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] The wound's deep!</b></font>

313
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:14,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But none of my organs
are falling out!</b></font>

314
00:21:14,230 --> 00:21:15,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now we're both
unarmed!</b></font>

315
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:17,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can win!</b></font>

316
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:24,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RIKA] What are you two doing?</b></font>

317
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:30,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] We're playing, Rika.
That's all.</b></font>

318
00:21:31,670 --> 00:21:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] "Rika"?
What is this thing?</b></font>

319
00:21:34,170 --> 00:21:37,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A shikigami?
Where did it come from?</b></font>

320
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:40,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Hold him still.</b></font>

321
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:42,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts] I can't move!</b></font>

322
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:46,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So strong!</b></font>

323
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:55,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I'm sorry...</b></font>

324
00:22:01,700 --> 00:22:03,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori.</b></font>

325
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:12,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

326
00:23:40,090 --> 00:23:41,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Older brothers
less competent</b></font>

327
00:23:41,630 --> 00:23:43,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than younger brothers
serve no purpose.</b></font>

328
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:45,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] I can't understand how
you never loved your brothers.</b></font>

329
00:23:45,550 --> 00:23:47,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Please report
Itadori's death.</b></font>

330
00:23:47,130 --> 00:23:48,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] That's when
all the distortions started.</b></font>

331
00:23:48,890 --> 00:23:50,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
Don't look down on me!</b></font>

332
00:23:50,510 --> 00:23:52,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGUMI] Start by saving me.
-[CHOSO] This is checkmate.</b></font>

333
00:23:52,430 --> 00:23:54,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Tsumiki has been
drawn into this game, too.</b></font>

